    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10902" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">contrĭbūtĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		contribuo (postclass.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A dividing, distributing</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">debiti et crediti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					16, 2, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in contributionem venire,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">ib. 24, 3, 7, § 4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">35, 2,
				30, § 8</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A contribution</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">omnium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					14, 2, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
